\pard\widctlpar\fi-360\li1080\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\ulnone\b0\f3\fs22\'b7\tab\f0\fs24 Comparing nucleic acids or other molecules to infer relatedness is a valuable tool for tracing organisms\rquote  evolutionary history\par
\f3\fs22\'b7\tab\f0\fs24 DNA that codes for rRNA changes relatively slowly and is useful for investigating branching points hundreds of millions of years ago\par
\f3\fs22\'b7\tab\f0\fs24 mtDNA evolves rapidly and can be used to explore recent evolutionary events \par

